[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:Don't Drop It!]
[00:00.90]Lesson 39 | 第39课
[00:02.70]Don't drop it! | 不要摔掉它！
[00:05.50]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音，然后回答问题。
[00:11.58]Where does Sam put the vase in the end? | 萨姆最后把花瓶放在了哪里？
[00:17.48]What are you going to do with that vase, Penny? | 你打算怎样处置那个花瓶，彭妮？
[00:23.50]I'm going to put it on this table, Sam. | 萨姆，我准备把它放在这张桌子上。
[00:28.56]Don't do that. | 不要那样做。
[00:31.05]Give it to me. | 把它给我。
[00:33.14]What are you going to do with it? | 你打算怎么处置它？
[00:36.90]I'm going to put it here, in front of the window. | 我准备把它放在这儿，窗户前面。
[00:42.70]Be careful! Don't drop it! | 小心！别把它摔了！
[00:46.78]Don't put it there, Sam. | 萨姆，别把它放在那儿。
[00:49.89]Put it here, on this shelf. | 把它放在这儿，这个架子上。
[00:53.48]There we are! | 好了！
[00:56.43]It's a lovely vase. | 这是一个漂亮的花瓶。
[00:59.00]Those flowers are lovely, too. | 那些花也很漂亮。